e\n  workspace; use `report_blocked` only once you've established (via tool calls) that\n  the task can't be done. Both terminate the trial — choose carefully.\n\n\n\nYou are a helpful assistant attempting to submit the best possible answer. You have several tools available to help with finding the answer. You will see the result of tool calls right after sending the message. If you need to perform multiple actions, you can always send more messages with additional tool calls. Do some reasoning before your actions, describing what tool calls you are going to use and how they fit into your plan.\n"},{"role":"user","content":"Before we go live with the onboarding service I need an auth-scope audit: mint a fresh default client_credentials token with no scope override and use it against the imagery manifest, then give me back the verbatim error code and hint the API returns.\n\nWhen you have finished, report your final answer as a single JSON object inside a ```json code block, with exactly these field(s): `error_code`, `error_hint`. Use the exact field name(s) shown, and put each requested value as that field's value — ONE value per field (a single scalar; if your work touched several items, report only the final/target value for each field, never a list or per-item map)."},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","reasoning":"gAAAAABqQtEOa3JWUFi6X5ORY12Yy1jFTjQa7kdKBmkQC6z9MoSo3ClgXPMDEsLJDitgweud8H1HcUJ35X9Ce4r-vKyLHoQ4dbYT35vOTpLguXB7ggNcIWT2or_8r8W8N9P1JXz5e8HFVrIEIyGPJwYnWGXaChdJF9eUAdifDmJPOB3gnRxcFBtyHrMXHtJxxCsS1Yrur85kXYMibmxIfEthVbVZyFilhoVdHyFkT7A_VZ1a_VbSPU1JYBDzyYmQQYE2KyRkszJwIne6BC0QbPNXRQnXFmEjTbWEXKqkBLYy9AboUm26yzeL6kczr9sWXP4C7oNbgktpkb73Bn_Q3SywQRX60SYTnz-p8NC_8qATQ7xPkApqsjGFG6yfMpTtpl1VMUKaFdQNxXrIm5nz2tGx2CqO1x9UDBghmT3PE6l5ImDCSIhRxNiuPz1hlpsWFUcnoRJoSWFVKckE7nuxCWK5WTeOiNBzhAJPWDhKpwk9f_pgP4K3YNKLtIapnGKsyiKmo_dDXIT_WKQ11R5xWkfc4FT6gdCdbfGmx_V0ptiYH6RL-HYumj9XBHy_Q_7pG1fheLgQxeY80hgy2eNK5FDcv-Fon0-Fg8EG6X0CUjWfPPI0umjUOGOHqzHbiL65jTl6